# Internal business strategy - this repo is public, keep it local only.
/GROWTH_PLAN.md

# On-device dictation runtime + model, fetched at build time by
# scripts/predownload-dictation-model.mjs. Roughly 40 MB of binaries that have
# no business in git; the directory's README.md is committed so the Tauri
# resource glob always matches.
/src-tauri/resources/dictation/*
!/src-tauri/resources/dictation/README.md
/src-tauri/resources/dictation/installed.json
